<h3>Detectors Used To Unfold</h3>

<p>Check the detectors that you wish to performing the unfolding with.  
Athough data my be entered for all of the detectors BUMS only uses the
ones which you select.  This allows you to compare unfoldings with many 
different combinations of detectors.</p>
 
<p>For example try unfolding your measurements with and without the bare 
detector.  How do the results and the fit errors change?</p> 

